### A1 focused demo — an ambient injection vector is live in the parent and
### never reaches a harness-built child; credential-bearing values are dropped
### and caught by the run-time guard.

# canary preload (/tmp/t026-evil-preload.cjs):
#   require('node:fs').appendFileSync('/tmp/t026-evil-canary.txt', process.pid)
$ DOCKER_HOST='tcp://user:password@docker.internal:2375' \
    HTTPS_PROXY='http://proxy-user:proxy-password@proxy.internal:8080' \
    NODE_OPTIONS='--require /tmp/t026-evil-preload.cjs' \
    NODE_PATH='/tmp/evil-modules' \
    node --input-type=module -e '<spawn an old-style child and a harness-style child>'

ambient values the harness excludes (name -> reason):
